      "title": "Corn quiet, beans bounce",
      "body": "- Dec corn is at **$4.54½** overnight, off ½ cent after a string of lower closes.\n- Nov beans are at $12.48¾, up 7½ cents, while meal gained 0.5% and soybean oil lost 0.4%.\n- Nothing new is out overnight for either grain.",
      "so_what": "Beans are getting back some of Monday's loss; corn has no news behind it.",
